        "name": "Icathian Rain",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Kai'Sa shoots a swarm of missiles that seek out nearby targets.<br><br>Living Weapon: Icathian Rain is upgraded to shoot more missiles.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kai'Sa launches 6 missiles that split among nearby enemies, each dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/55/70/85/100 + (55% bonus Attack Damage) + (20% Ability Power)) physical damage</span>, up to a maximum of (90/123.75/157.5/191.25/225 + (123.75% bonus Attack Damage) + (45% Ability Power)). Additional missile hits on champions or monsters deal 25% damage.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Evolved</span>: Kai'Sa instead fires 12 missiles.<br />Current: <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">?/100 Bonus Attack Damage</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Minions below <span>35% Health</span> take 200% damage.</span>",
