        "summary": "Kai'Sa briefly increases her Move Speed, then increases her Attack Speed.<br><br>Living Weapon: Supercharge is upgraded to briefly grant Invisibility.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kai'Sa supercharges her void energy, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">55/60/65/70/75% Move Speed</span> and becoming Ghosted while charging, then gaining <span>4000/5000/6000/7000/8000% Attack Speed</span> for 4 seconds.<br /><br />Attacks reduce this Ability's Cooldown by 0.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Evolved</span>: Kai'Sa also becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> for 0.5 seconds.<br />Current: <span>?%/100% Bonus Attack Speed</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units can pass through other units.<br /><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> units cannot be revealed except by turrets or <span style=\"color: #ee91d7\">True Sight</font color>.<br />The charge time scales down with <span>Attack Speed</span> (Current: 1.2)</span>",
